<title>CHINA: Shanghai Cereals &amp; Oils Exchange closed.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Cereals &amp; Oils Exchange closed.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai Cereals &amp; Oils Exchange was closed on Wednesday for the New Year holiday and trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>Soybean contracts on the exchange closed up in the last session of 1996, with the key January 1997 contract rising 120 yuan to end at 3,230 yuan per tonne, traders said.</p>
</text>
